#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:2
msgid "Logging Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral dos Logs"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| provides a comprehensive logging system that captures, "
"aggregates, and forwards logs from the appliance, managed hosts, and "
"virtual machines."
msgstr "O |morpheus| oferece um sistema abrangente de logs que captura, agrega e encaminha logs do appliance, hosts gerenciados e máquinas virtuais."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:7
msgid "Log Sources"
msgstr "Origens de Log"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:13
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Origem"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:14
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Localização"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:15
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrição"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:16
msgid "Application Logs"
msgstr "Logs da Aplicação"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:17
#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:23
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/``"
msgstr "``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-ui/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:18
msgid ""
"|morpheus| application server logs (Tomcat/Grails). Includes API "
"requests, provisioning operations, and application errors."
msgstr "Logs do servidor de aplicação |morpheus| (Tomcat/Grails). Inclui solicitações de API, operações de provisionamento e erros da aplicação."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:19
msgid "Audit Logs"
msgstr "Logs de Auditoria"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:20
msgid "Application database + UI"
msgstr "Banco de dados da aplicação + interface"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:21
msgid ""
"User actions, login events, and configuration changes. Viewable in "
"|AdmAct|."
msgstr "Ações de usuário, eventos de login e alterações de configuração. Visualizável em |AdmAct|."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:22
msgid "API Logs"
msgstr "Logs de API"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:24
msgid ""
"REST API request/response logging (when enabled via logback "
"configuration)."
msgstr "Registro de solicitação/resposta da API REST (quando habilitado via configuração do logback)."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:25
msgid "Nginx Logs"
msgstr "Logs do Nginx"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:26
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/nginx/``"
msgstr "``/var/log/morpheus/nginx/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:27
msgid "Web server access and error logs for the appliance reverse proxy."
msgstr "Logs de acesso e erro do servidor web para o proxy reverso do appliance."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:28
msgid "MySQL Logs"
msgstr "Logs do MySQL"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:29
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/mysql/``"
msgstr "``/var/log/morpheus/mysql/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:30
msgid ""
"Database server logs (embedded MySQL). Not present when using an external"
" database."
msgstr "Logs do servidor de banco de dados (MySQL incorporado). Não presente ao usar um banco de dados externo."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:31
msgid "RabbitMQ Logs"
msgstr "Logs do RabbitMQ"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:32
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq/``"
msgstr "``/var/log/morpheus/rabbitmq/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:33
msgid "Message queue logs. Not present when using an external RabbitMQ cluster."
msgstr "Logs da fila de mensagens. Não presente ao usar um cluster RabbitMQ externo."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:34
msgid "OpenSearch Logs"
msgstr "Logs do OpenSearch"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:35
msgid "``/var/log/morpheus/opensearch/``"
msgstr "``/var/log/morpheus/opensearch/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:36
msgid "Search and log indexing engine logs."
msgstr "Logs do mecanismo de indexação de busca e logs."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:37
msgid "Agent Logs"
msgstr "Logs do Agente"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:38
msgid "Managed hosts: ``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-node/``"
msgstr "Hosts gerenciados: ``/var/log/morpheus/morpheus-node/``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:39
msgid "|morpheus| Agent logs on managed Linux hosts and HVM hypervisors."
msgstr "Logs do Agente |morpheus| em hosts Linux gerenciados e hypervisors HVM."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:40
msgid "Host/VM Logs"
msgstr "Logs de Host/VM"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:41
msgid "Managed hosts: ``/var/log/*.log``"
msgstr "Hosts gerenciados: ``/var/log/*.log``"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:42
msgid ""
"Application and system logs collected by the |morpheus| Agent from "
"managed VMs and hosts."
msgstr "Logs de aplicação e sistema coletados pelo Agente |morpheus| de VMs e hosts gerenciados."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:45
msgid "Log Storage"
msgstr "Armazenamento de Logs"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:47
msgid ""
"Logs collected from managed hosts and VMs are stored in **OpenSearch** on"
" the appliance. These logs are searchable and viewable in the following "
"locations:"
msgstr "Os logs coletados de hosts e VMs gerenciados são armazenados no **OpenSearch** no appliance. Esses logs são pesquisáveis e visualizáveis nos seguintes locais:"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:49
msgid "**Instance Logs** — Logs tab on an Instance detail page"
msgstr "**Logs de Instância** — guia Logs na página de detalhes de uma Instância"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:50
msgid "**Host Logs** — Logs tab on a Host detail page"
msgstr "**Logs de Host** — guia Logs na página de detalhes de um Host"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:51
msgid "**Global Logs** — |MonLog| for cross-instance log search"
msgstr "**Logs Globais** — |MonLog| para busca de logs entre instâncias"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:53
msgid ""
"Log retention is controlled by the **Availability Time Frame** setting in"
" |AdmSetMon|. Logs older than the configured retention period are "
"automatically purged."
msgstr "A retenção de logs é controlada pela configuração **Availability Time Frame** em |AdmSetMon|. Logs mais antigos que o período de retenção configurado são expurgados automaticamente."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:55
#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:89
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:55
msgid ""
"Appliance service logs (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx) are stored on"
" the local filesystem and are not indexed in OpenSearch. Use the "
"appliance log configuration to manage rotation and retention for these "
"logs. See :doc:`appliance_logs` for details."
msgstr "Os logs de serviço do appliance (MySQL, RabbitMQ, OpenSearch, Nginx) são armazenados no sistema de arquivos local e não são indexados no OpenSearch. Use a configuração de logs do appliance para gerenciar rotação e retenção desses logs. Consulte :doc:`appliance_logs` para detalhes."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:58
msgid "Disabling Logging"
msgstr "Desabilitar Logs"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:60
msgid ""
"Log collection from managed hosts can be disabled globally in |AdmSetMon|"
" using the logging toggle. When disabled:"
msgstr "A coleta de logs de hosts gerenciados pode ser desabilitada globalmente em |AdmSetMon| usando o alternador de logs. Quando desabilitado:"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:62
msgid "The |morpheus| Agent stops forwarding logs from managed hosts"
msgstr "O Agente |morpheus| para de encaminhar logs de hosts gerenciados"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:63
msgid "Existing logs remain searchable until they expire per the retention policy"
msgstr "Os logs existentes permanecem pesquisáveis até expirarem conforme a política de retenção"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:64
msgid ""
"Appliance service logs continue to be written to disk regardless of this "
"setting"
msgstr "Os logs de serviço do appliance continuam sendo gravados em disco independentemente desta configuração"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:67
msgid "Distributed Trace IDs"
msgstr "IDs de Rastreamento Distribuído"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:69
msgid ""
"|morpheus| includes a **trace ID** in all application log entries to "
"correlate operations that span multiple threads, background jobs, or "
"agent interactions. This is essential for troubleshooting complex "
"operations like provisioning, migration, or failover that involve "
"multiple asynchronous steps."
msgstr "O |morpheus| inclui um **ID de rastreamento** em todas as entradas de log da aplicação para correlacionar operações que abrangem várias threads, jobs em segundo plano ou interações com o agente. Isso é essencial para solucionar problemas em operações complexas como provisionamento, migração ou failover que envolvem várias etapas assíncronas."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:71
msgid "**How it works:**"
msgstr "**Como funciona:**"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:73
msgid ""
"Each incoming request or scheduled job is assigned a unique trace ID (W3C"
" traceparent format)"
msgstr "Cada solicitação recebida ou job agendado recebe um ID de rastreamento exclusivo (formato W3C traceparent)"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:74
msgid ""
"The trace ID propagates automatically across thread boundaries, "
"background jobs, parallel tasks, and agent communication"
msgstr "O ID de rastreamento se propaga automaticamente entre limites de thread, jobs em segundo plano, tarefas paralelas e comunicação com o agente"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:75
msgid ""
"All log entries produced during the operation include the same trace ID "
"in the log output"
msgstr "Todas as entradas de log produzidas durante a operação incluem o mesmo ID de rastreamento na saída do log"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:77
msgid "**Using trace IDs for troubleshooting:**"
msgstr "**Usando IDs de rastreamento para solução de problemas:**"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:79
msgid ""
"To follow a single operation through the logs, search for the trace ID "
"value. For example, a provisioning operation that triggers cloud sync, "
"network configuration, and agent installation will share the same trace "
"ID across all log entries, even if they execute on different threads or "
"at different times."
msgstr "Para acompanhar uma única operação nos logs, pesquise pelo valor do ID de rastreamento. Por exemplo, uma operação de provisionamento que aciona sincronização de nuvem, configuração de rede e instalação do agente compartilhará o mesmo ID de rastreamento em todas as entradas de log, mesmo que sejam executadas em threads diferentes ou em momentos diferentes."

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:81
msgid ""
"When configured in the logback pattern (see :doc:`appliance_logs`), the "
"trace ID appears as the ``traceId`` MDC field:"
msgstr "Quando configurado no padrão do logback (consulte :doc:`appliance_logs`), o ID de rastreamento aparece como o campo MDC ``traceId``:"

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:83
msgid ""
"2026-07-13 10:15:32.001 [traceId=abc123def456] INFO  "
"c.m.provision.KvmProvisionService - Starting VM provisioning\n"
"2026-07-13 10:15:32.150 [traceId=abc123def456] INFO  "
"c.m.network.NetworkService - Configuring network for VM\n"
"2026-07-13 10:15:33.200 [traceId=abc123def456] INFO  "
"c.m.agent.CommandService - Sending agent install command"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/logging/overview.rst:89
msgid ""
"Trace IDs are also passed to the |morpheus| Agent via W3C traceparent "
"headers, allowing end-to-end correlation from the appliance through to "
"host-level operations."
msgstr "Os IDs de rastreamento também são passados ao Agente |morpheus| via cabeçalhos W3C traceparent, permitindo correlação de ponta a ponta do appliance até operações em nível de host."

